{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794476380551,"sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_liyi9v9krhd8np8qo1knlhdu","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"id\\|command\\|reason\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json; echo \"---README-LINES---\"; grep -n \"third source\\|one bridge per doctor route\\|The deriver combines\\|activation\\|Activation\\|active\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md | head -20; echo \"---GEN-COUNT-LINES---\"; sed -n '1,14p' .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"3:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit-plan\",\n4:    \"command\": \"/speckit:plan\",\n7:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns the live planning command but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n10:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit-complete\",\n11:    \"command\": \"/speckit:complete\",\n14:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns the live completion command but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n17:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit-implement\",\n18:    \"command\": \"/speckit:implement\",\n21:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns the live implementation command but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n24:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit-resume\",\n25:    \"command\": \"/speckit:resume\",\n28:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns the live resume command but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n31:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit\",\n32:    \"command\": \"/spec_kit\",\n35:    \"reason\": \"The deprecated generic Spec Kit bridge remains live for one-release compatibility and has no JSON command entry.\"\n38:    \"id\": \"command-memory-save\",\n39:    \"command\": \"/memory:save\",\n42:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns memory persistence but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n45:    \"id\": \"memory:save\",\n46:    \"command\": \"/memory:save\",\n49:    \"reason\": \"The TypeScript scorer retains this second legacy id for the metadata-free memory save command.\"\n52:    \"id\": \"command-prompt-improver\",\n53:    \"command\": \"/prompt\",\n56:    \"reason\": \"The Python compatibility scorer still recognizes legacy /prompt while JSON declares /prompt:improve.\"\n---README-LINES---\n16:`command-bridges/` is the source boundary for command metadata that is not yet represented uniformly by every scoring surface. The deriver combines live skill metadata with the authored compatibility inputs and writes the generated JSON projection.\n18:The doctor commands are a third source: the deriver reads `.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml` and writes one bridge per doctor route and per standalone doctor command and per MCP sub-route.\n64:Each `mcp_subroutes` entry becomes the bridge `command-doctor-mcp-<sub_action>`, with the runnable string `/doctor:mcp <sub_action>` and its owner from the `skill_agent` tag in `mcp.md`. Every derived doctor bridge is active in both scorers, and `doctor-phrase-reach.cjs` proves each one.\n---GEN-COUNT-LINES---\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"generatedBy\": \"scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\",\n  \"counts\": {\n    \"commandMetadata\": 19,\n    \"allowList\": 8,\n    \"doctorRoutes\": 35,\n    \"generated\": 62,\n    \"typescriptActive\": 40,\n    \"pythonActive\": 50\n  },\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"command-create-agent\",\n","metadata":{"output":"3:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit-plan\",\n4:    \"command\": \"/speckit:plan\",\n7:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns the live planning command but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n10:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit-complete\",\n11:    \"command\": \"/speckit:complete\",\n14:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns the live completion command but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n17:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit-implement\",\n18:    \"command\": \"/speckit:implement\",\n21:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns the live implementation command but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n24:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit-resume\",\n25:    \"command\": \"/speckit:resume\",\n28:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns the live resume command but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n31:    \"id\": \"command-spec-kit\",\n32:    \"command\": \"/spec_kit\",\n35:    \"reason\": \"The deprecated generic Spec Kit bridge remains live for one-release compatibility and has no JSON command entry.\"\n38:    \"id\": \"command-memory-save\",\n39:    \"command\": \"/memory:save\",\n42:    \"reason\": \"system-spec-kit owns memory persistence but has no command-metadata.json yet.\"\n45:    \"id\": \"memory:save\",\n46:    \"command\": \"/memory:save\",\n49:    \"reason\": \"The TypeScript scorer retains this second legacy id for the metadata-free memory save command.\"\n52:    \"id\": \"command-prompt-improver\",\n53:    \"command\": \"/prompt\",\n56:    \"reason\": \"The Python compatibility scorer still recognizes legacy /prompt while JSON declares /prompt:improve.\"\n---README-LINES---\n16:`command-bridges/` is the source boundary for command metadata that is not yet represented uniformly by every scoring surface. The deriver combines live skill metadata with the authored compatibility inputs and writes the generated JSON projection.\n18:The doctor commands are a third source: the deriver reads `.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml` and writes one bridge per doctor route and per standalone doctor command and per MCP sub-route.\n64:Each `mcp_subroutes` entry becomes the bridge `command-doctor-mcp-<sub_action>`, with the runnable string `/doctor:mcp <sub_action>` and its owner from the `skill_agent` tag in `mcp.md`. Every derived doctor bridge is active in both scorers, and `doctor-phrase-reach.cjs` proves each one.\n---GEN-COUNT-LINES---\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"generatedBy\": \"scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\",\n  \"counts\": {\n    \"commandMetadata\": 19,\n    \"allowList\": 8,\n    \"doctorRoutes\": 35,\n    \"generated\": 62,\n    \"typescriptActive\": 40,\n    \"pythonActive\": 50\n  },\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"command-create-agent\",\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"grep -n \"id\\|command\\|reason\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json; echo \"---README-LINES---\"; grep -n \"third source\\|one bridge per doctor route\\|The deriver combines\\|activation\\|Activation\\|active\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md | head -20; echo \"---GEN-COUNT-LINES---\"; sed -n '1,14p' .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json","time":{"start":1794476380523,"end":1794476380550}},"id":"prt_1cf208eae001jgailHB6kPEr8Z","sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","messageID":"msg_1cf207ad50018aaq5JH9mV5Eeu"}}
