{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794476436155,"sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_deeowi9e0x0c7f9qmoafuv84","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"run\":1,\"runId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Command inventory drift across three metadata sources\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":0.95,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Seven findings are all new to this lineage; the 0.95 discount reflects partial overlap with the sibling 003 doctor-surfacing packet.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which commands have no active bridge, which bridges point at retired names, and what does one drift-proof command inventory need?\",\"Why do plain planning and research prompts return no recommendation, how does command intent compete with skill intent in fusion, and what do the no-slash penalty and mutating-command gate cost in recall versus precision?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which commands have no active bridge, which bridges point at retired names, and what does one drift-proof command inventory need?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Counting generated bridge entries as commands\",\"Treating the allow-list as a complete fallback\"],\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Glob\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/commands\",\"/skdills/system-deep-loop/command-metadata.json\".replace(\"/skdills\",\"/.skilled/skills\"),\".skilled/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-12T09:40:24Z\",\"durationMs\":153000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-inventory\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Which commands have no active bridge and which bridges point at retired names\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Only 19 of 45 commands have command-metadata.json\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Four live commands have no generated bridge\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Only 40 TypeScript and 50 Python bridges are active\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-007\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Drift-proof inventory needs tree-derived completeness gate\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"target\":\"q-inventory\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"target\":\"q-inventory\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"target\":\"q-inventory\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-004\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-007\",\"target\":\"q-inventory\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"label\":\"The live command surface is 45 markdown files: 44 grouped commands plus local-skilled-alignment.md; only 19 appear in a command-metadata.json because only system-deep-loop, sk-design and sk-doc publish command metadata.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/command-metadata.json:1\",\".skilled/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-002\",\"label\":\"The generated projection has 62 entries from 19 command-metadata rows, 8 allow-list rows and 35 doctor routes, collapsing to 43 distinct command spellings.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json:4\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md:18\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"label\":\"Four live grouped commands have no generated bridge: /prompt:improve, /speckit:handoff, /speckit:save and /speckit:search; the allow-list bridges /prompt under its retired spelling.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json:52\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json:7\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"label\":\"Three generated bridges name non-live spellings: /spec_kit is deprecated, /memory:save is a retained legacy key and /prompt is the legacy name for /prompt:improve.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json:35\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json:49\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json:56\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"label\":\"Activation is platform-specific: 40 of 62 entries are active for TypeScript and 50 for Python; 22 entries are TypeScript-inactive, including every /deep:*, every /design:*, 11 of 13 /create:* and four /speckit:* commands.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json:9\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json:10\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-006\",\"label\":\"The doctor family is the only fully connected slice: every derived doctor bridge is active in both scorers and doctor-phrase-reach.cjs proves its phrase coverage, while no equivalent reach proof exists for the other families.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/README.md:64\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-007\",\"label\":\"A drift-proof inventory needs one command-tree-derived registry with a completeness gate: every command file must carry owner metadata or an allow-list justification, and a bridge naming a non-live spelling must fail validation; the current deriver never compares its three inputs to the live tree.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs:21\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs:87\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Counting command-bridges.generated.json entries as commands\",\"reason\":\"62 entries include 35 doctor routes and three retired aliases, so the count overstates the 43 distinct live commands\",\"iteration\":1}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating allow-list.json as a complete fallback inventory\",\"reason\":\"It covers 8 commands, misses four live commands and adds three retired aliases\",\"iteration\":1}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepse