{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794476653650,"sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_e05eypsrrpw0f4oadc4nahd0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"run\":2,\"runId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Scoring: why plain planning and research prompts return zero\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":0.9,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All seven findings are new to this lineage; the 0.9 discount reflects the scoring angle overlapping the inventory finding about inactive bridges.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Why do plain planning and research prompts return no recommendation, how does command intent compete with skill intent in fusion, and what do the no-slash penalty and mutating-command gate cost in recall versus precision?\",\"What must the advisor render inside the 80 to 120 token brief for a model to act on a command, given that advisor_recommend has no kind or runnable field?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Why do plain planning and research prompts return no recommendation, how does command intent compete with skill intent in fusion, and what do the no-slash penalty and mutating-command gate cost in recall versus precision?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Lowering the confidence threshold alone as the fix\",\"Treating the no-slash penalty as the cause of zero recommendations\"],\"edgeCase\":\"ambiguous-input\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/compat/contract.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/