-advisor/runtime/lib/compat/contract.ts:9\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:1245\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-002\",\"label\":\"For the research prompt the candidates are system-spec-kit 0.5874, cli-external-orchestration 0.5759 and sk-prompt 0.5747; command-deep-research is projected with routingEnabled false and empty keywords, domains and intent signals, so it never enters the race.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/projection.ts:1061\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-003\",\"label\":\"A typed /speckit:plan prompt returns command-spec-kit and system-spec-kit at 0.82, but the bridge's entire keyword set is four slash markers, so it has no plain-language planning phrase a chat prompt could match.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json:3\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/projection.ts:80\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-004\",\"label\":\"The no-slash penalty is a rank-only minus 0.08 applied to command-kind candidates when the prompt contains no slash; it cannot create a recommendation from a failing candidate and only pushes commands below skills when both are close.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:1197\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"label\":\"The mutating-command gate lifts a command off the read-only explainer floor only when skill.readOnly is true; the deriver sets that flag only for manifest routes whose mutating value is read-only, so add-only and mutating commands stay gated.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:686\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs:305\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"label\":\"The gate's recall cost is measurable: show me the plan for the login page returns zero recommendations, while run the planning workflow for a new login feature returns sk-doc, cli-external-orchestration and sk-code at 0.82 instead of the planning command.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:673\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-007\",\"label\":\"Fusion gives command intent only the explicit-author lane and generic lexical overlap; active non-doctor bridges carry either diagnostic doctor phrases or bare slash markers, so chat planning and research intent reaches a skill hub first.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:522\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json:4\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Lowering the confidence threshold alone as the fix\",\"reason\":\"At threshold 0 the planning prompt surfaces sk-doc, sk-code and system-spec-kit, not a command, so lower thresholds amplify wrong-skill routing\",\"iteration\":2}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating the no-slash penalty as the cause of zero recommendations\",\"reason\":\"The penalty only reorders already-passing candidates; the zero result comes from the 0.8 confidence floor and missing command descriptors\",\"iteration\":2}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl","exists":false,"truncated