{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794476765526,"sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_658uhb1o31y5430rv6re9w8s","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"run\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Output contract of the 80 to 120 token brief\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":0.9,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All seven findings are new; the 0.9 discount reflects that the brief's doctor-only runnable map restates the inventory finding about doctor-only coverage.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What must the advisor render inside the 80 to 120 token brief for a model to act on a command, given that advisor_recommend has no kind or runnable field?\",\"Which commands are safe to start without asking, which need a question first, judged by what they write and what they can undo, and where should that run-or-ask policy live?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What must the advisor render inside the 80 to 120 token brief for a model to act on a command, given that advisor_recommend has no kind or runnable field?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Raising the token cap as the fix\",\"Reusing the doctor map shape without an authoritative command source\"],\"edgeCase\":\"ambiguous-input\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/skill-advisor-brief.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts\",\"buildSkillAdvisorBrief measured output\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-12T09:45:38Z\",\"durationMs\":98000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-output-contract\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"What must the brief carry for a model to act on a command\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Brief budget is 80 default and 120 ambiguous tokens\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Doctor ids map to runnable strings; non-doctor ids do not\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Recommendation payload has no kind or runnable field\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter003-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"target\":\"q-output-contract\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter003-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"target\":\"q-output-contract\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter003-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"target\":\"q-output-contract\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"label\":\"The brief budget is 80 tokens by default and 120 when ambiguous, hard-capped at 120 with a 4-characters-per-token estimate; the fixed comment-hygiene directive block is appended after the capped head.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:97\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/skill-advisor-brief.ts:146\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"label\":\"The actionable brief has one shape, Advisor: live; use <label> <confidence>/<uncertainty> pass., plus an optional Also: <doctor runnable> line; it carries no command kind, argument hint, run-or-ask verdict or undo class.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:541\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"label\":\"Doctor bridges render through a generated 35-entry id-to-runnable map, measured as /doctor:env list and /doctor:git hooks; this map is the only id-to-runnable translation in the renderer.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:109\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:219\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"label\":\"Non-doctor commands fall back to metadataSkillLabel or the raw bridge id; a literal /speckit:plan prompt produced the ambiguous brief naming command-spec-kit 0.82/0.20 against system-spec-kit 0.82/0.18.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:511\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"label\":\"The recommendation payload has skillId, score, confidence, uncertainty, dominantLane and status, plus optional workflowMode and routing diagnostics, but no kind, runnable or argumentHint field.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts:295\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"label\":\"A model needs a runnable invocation string, a command-versus-skill discriminator, a run-or-ask verdict and a consequence or undo note; the current brief supplies only the label and two scores, and the doctor map proves the runnable-string part fits the budget when the data exists.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:541\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-007\",\"label\":\"The budget is not the blocker: the measured ambiguous head is about 86 characters, the directive block about 205 characters and a generic command line under 40 characters, all inside the 480-character ambiguous budget.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:185\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Raising the token cap as the fix\",\"reason\":\"The omission is a data-contract gap and the measured briefs fit inside the existing cap\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Reusing the doctor map shape without an authoritative source\",\"reason\":\"The doctor map is generated from the route manifest; a universal map needs an authoritative command manifest, not a hand-written table\",\"iteration\":3}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl","time":{"start":1794476765519,"end":1794476765525}},"id":"prt_1cf265d36001capqVwRRUCTYqI","sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","messageID":"msg_1cf264d22001H6Al8wNfm0NPYQ"}}
