{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794476845996,"sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_mltwjkim7dcr4h4rqeyjb8rq","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"run\":4,\"runId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Run-or-ask policy for 45 commands\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":0.85,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All seven findings are new; the 0.85 discount reflects that the mutation-class gap overlaps the inventory and scoring findings.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which commands are safe to start without asking, which need a question first, judged by what they write and what they can undo, and where should that run-or-ask policy live?\",\"Can a model start a slash command itself on Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex, Pi, Cursor, Devin and DSH, and what is the fallback where it cannot?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which commands are safe to start without asking, which need a question first, judged by what they write and what they can undo, and where should that run-or-ask policy live?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Reusing the readOnlyRouteAllowed boolean as the whole policy\",\"A universal ask-first rule\"],\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json\",\".skilled/commands/create/README.txt\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-confirm.yaml\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-plan.yaml\",\"AGENTS.md\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-12T09:47:14Z\",\"durationMs\":96000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-run-or-ask\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Which commands are safe to start without asking and where should the policy live\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Doctor manifest is the only explicit mutation classification\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Command metadata carries no safety class\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Auto and confirm modes already encode run versus ask\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter004-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"target\":\"q-run-or-ask\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter004-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"target\":\"q-run-or-ask\",\"relation\":\"CONTRADICTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter004-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"target\":\"q-run-or-ask\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"label\":\"The doctor route manifest is the only command set with an explicit mutation class: 16 read-only, 3 add-only and 22 mutates entries, each with a gate3_location naming what it writes.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:69\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:110\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"label\":\"The 19 command-metadata entries carry no mutation or safety field; their schema is command, ownerMode, description, argumentHint, userIntent, choreography and discriminator.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json:3\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"label\":\"Every create command ships :auto (no approval prompts) and :confirm (pause at each step); deep-research uses approvals none versus multi_gate, and speckit-plan has both step_by_step and autonomous branches.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/create/README.txt:28\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:26\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-confirm.yaml:11\",\".skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-plan.yaml:27\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-004\",\"label\":\"Gate 3 already implements ask-before-write at framework level, firing on file writes and excluding read-only review, audit, inspect and explain, but it acts after the workflow is chosen rather than at recommendation time.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"AGENTS.md:72\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"label\":\"The advisor's only safety mechanism is readOnlyRouteAllowed, which consults skill.readOnly; a mutating command that passes on a write-intent prompt is recommended with no ask marker and the brief has no field to carry one.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:686\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-006\",\"label\":\"Recommended policy: carry a three-class safety map of read-only, add-only and mutating plus the write root in each command's metadata; run read-only immediately, run add-only when the target is explicit, and ask for mutating or unclear targets, with Gate 3 as the backstop.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:69\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json:3\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-007\",\"label\":\"Always asking for mutating commands would conflict with the shipped :auto mode, so the run-or-ask default must be overridable by a typed :auto or :confirm suffix and by explicit user instruction.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/create/README.txt:28\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Reusing readOnlyRouteAllowed as the whole policy\",\"reason\":\"It has no ask state and no write root, so it can suppress a recommendation but cannot tell the model what to do next\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A universal ask-first rule\",\"reason\":\"It contradicts the shipped :auto mode and adds a question before every read-only command\",\"iteration\":4}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl","time":{"start":1794476845984,"end":1794476845995}},"id":"prt_1cf2796c10019A2e4nkIKqedZu","sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","messageID":"msg_1cf27881e001LyYbUBLQQXh0OF"}}
