{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794477020243,"sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_8yff9yjp8brtxqpoca890tm8","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":6,\"run\":6,\"runId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"How a chat-only request reaches a command workflow\",\"findingsCount\":9,\"newInfoRatio\":0.6,\"noveltyJustification\":\"The mode-registry linkage is new evidence; the advisory-only hook finding and no-discovery-rule finding overlap the sibling lineage, so the ratio is discounted.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which mechanism brings a request typed as plain chat onto the command workflow, and what is the evidence that workflows are hand-rolled today?\",\"Which commands never load the mode SKILL.md their metadata names, which skills have no command front door, and should a skill recommendation imply its command?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which mechanism brings a request typed as plain chat onto the command workflow, and what is the evidence that workflows are hand-rolled today?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"A hook-only mechanism\",\"A runner-refusal-only mechanism\",\"A static command list in AGENTS.md\"],\"edgeCase\":\"ambiguous-input\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md\",\"AGENTS.md\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/mode-registry.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json\",\"spec.md\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-12T09:50:08Z\",\"durationMs\":84000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-chat-only\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Which mechanism brings plain chat onto the command workflow\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Hook is advisory and fail-open\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-007\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Hub mode registries already bind modes to commands\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-008\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Recommended mechanism is brief command plus AGENTS.md Gate 2 rule\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter006-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter006-001\",\"target\":\"q-chat-only\",\"relation\":\"CONTRADICTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter006-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter006-007\",\"target\":\"q-chat-only\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter006-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter006-008\",\"target\":\"q-chat-only\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-001\",\"label\":\"The hook is advisory and fails open; it never replaces explicit skill loading and never blocks the prompt on an advisor failure, so it cannot redirect a chat request into a command by itself.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md:21\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-002\",\"label\":\"The brief names recommended skills; only doctor commands appear as runnable /doctor: strings, so non-doctor commands have no model-visible invocation in the one prompt-time channel reaching all runtimes.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md:43\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-003\",\"label\":\"Gate 2 tells the model to use the brief or advisor CLI and emit SKILL ROUTING, never to run a command workflow, so a chat-only request is steered toward a skill even when a command owns the workflow.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"AGENTS.md:69\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-004\",\"label\":\"PLAN-WORKFLOW LOCK forbids hand-rolling a plan-named workflow but says nothing about discovering that an unnamed command owns the request, so the prohibition cannot fire when the user types prose.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"AGENTS.md:20\",\"AGENTS.md:27\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-005\",\"label\":\"The brief is silent exactly when a chat-only user needs it: the measured planning and research prompts return zero recommendations at the shipped 0.8 threshold.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/spec.md:43\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-006\",\"label\":\"A runner refusal exists only as normative prose: deep-research says it is invoked exclusively through /deep:research:auto or :confirm, but that SKILL.md loads after the skill is chosen, which is after the hand-roll decision.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md:84\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-007\",\"label\":\"Hub mode registries already bind modes to commands: sk-doc records a command for every mode and states command-bridge modes are reached only via their command, while system-deep-loop records /deep:research with lexical routing.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/mode-registry.json:13\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:45\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-008\",\"label\":\"Recommended mechanism: the brief carries command, policy and ownerSkillId from the hub registry, and Gate 2 gains one rule to load and execute the command document when policy is run or offer it and wait when policy is ask.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/mode-registry.json:40\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:45\",\"AGENTS.md:69\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-009\",\"label\":\"Where the brief does not arrive, the mechanism needs a backstop: Gate 2 should also say that with no brief the model asks the advisor CLI before hand-rolling, because delivery can fail open to the directives fallback.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook.md:21\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A hook-only mechanism\",\"reason\":\"The hook is advisory, fails open and cannot dispatch a command\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A runner-refusal-only mechanism\",\"reason\":\"The refusal prose loads after the skill is chosen, too late to prevent the hand-roll\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A static command list in AGENTS.md\",\"reason\":\"45 commands with modes and arguments would drift and consume the rule budget\",\"iteration\":6}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl","time":{"start":1794477020237,"end":1794477020242}},"id":"prt_1cf2a3f6b001h7gybkQeit2KEw","sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","messageID":"msg_1cf2a2fc0001q4Tksgq6F0j71l"}}
