{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794477071864,"sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_5hs87729q4g4815q8wbczhxo","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"SKILL.md\\|mode contract\\|load\" .skilled/commands/create/skill.md | head -8; echo \"---DEEP-RESEARCH-CMD---\"; grep -n \"SKILL.md\\|mode contract\" .skilled/commands/deep/research.md | head -6; echo \"---DESIGN-EXTRACT---\"; grep -n \"SKILL.md\\|mode contract\" .skilled/commands/design/extract.md | head -6; echo \"---SPECKIT-PLAN-SKILL---\"; grep -n \"SKILL.md\" .skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md .skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-plan.yaml | head -4; echo \"---EXPLICIT-BOOST---\"; sed -n '92,100p' .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"71:Generated routing follows the routing canon: `SMART ROUTING` is 8 to 12 lines of plain prose, every generated skill and mode packet owns a sibling `ROUTER.md` inside its own folder, and that file holds the machine router under a final `## MACHINE ROUTER` heading. The `SKILL.md` links to its sibling router in relative markdown and carries no `## MACHINE ROUTER` section itself. For a hub, that sibling file is the root `ROUTER.md`.\n---DEEP-RESEARCH-CMD---\n99:4. In `:auto`, ask a targeted Tier-2 question only for `spec_folder` when the topic is present, names no resolvable spec folder, and the folder choice is ambiguous. Missing `research_topic` is absence, not ambiguity; use the named-missing-inputs fail-fast format from the auto-mode contract and do not load YAML.\n---DESIGN-EXTRACT---\n---SPECKIT-PLAN-SKILL---\n---EXPLICIT-BOOST---\nexport const PHRASE_BOOSTS: Readonly<Record<string, readonly [string, number][]>> = {\n  '/create:agent': [['create:agent', 1.6], ['sk-doc', 0.45]],\n  '/create:manual-testing-playbook': [['create:manual-testing-playbook', 1.8], ['command-create-manual-testing-playbook', 1.2], ['sk-doc', 0.2]],\n  '/memory:save': [['memory:save', 1.6], ['command-memory-save', 1], ['system-spec-kit', 0.45]],\n  '/speckit:save': [['memory:save', 1.6], ['command-memory-save', 1], ['system-spec-kit', 0.45]],\n  '/deep:research': [['system-deep-loop', 1.6], ['command-spec-kit', 0.45]],\n  '/deep:review': [['system-deep-loop', 1.6], ['command-spec-kit', 0.45]],\n  '/speckit:resume': [['system-spec-kit', 0.9], ['command-spec-kit', 0.75]],\n  'auto review release readiness': [['system-deep-loop', 1]],\n","metadata":{"output":"71:Generated routing follows the routing canon: `SMART ROUTING` is 8 to 12 lines of plain prose, every generated skill and mode packet owns a sibling `ROUTER.md` inside its own folder, and that file holds the machine router under a final `## MACHINE ROUTER` heading. The `SKILL.md` links to its sibling router in relative markdown and carries no `## MACHINE ROUTER` section itself. For a hub, that sibling file is the root `ROUTER.md`.\n---DEEP-RESEARCH-CMD---\n99:4. In `:auto`, ask a targeted Tier-2 question only for `spec_folder` when the topic is present, names no resolvable spec folder, and the folder choice is ambiguous. Missing `research_topic` is absence, not ambiguity; use the named-missing-inputs fail-fast format from the auto-mode contract and do not load YAML.\n---DESIGN-EXTRACT---\n---SPECKIT-PLAN-SKILL---\n---EXPLICIT-BOOST---\nexport const PHRASE_BOOSTS: Readonly<Record<string, readonly [string, number][]>> = {\n  '/create:agent': [['create:agent', 1.6], ['sk-doc', 0.45]],\n  '/create:manual-testing-playbook': [['create:manual-testing-playbook', 1.8], ['command-create-manual-testing-playbook', 1.2], ['sk-doc', 0.2]],\n  '/memory:save': [['memory:save', 1.6], ['command-memory-save', 1], ['system-spec-kit', 0.45]],\n  '/speckit:save': [['memory:save', 1.6], ['command-memory-save', 1], ['system-spec-kit', 0.45]],\n  '/deep:research': [['system-deep-loop', 1.6], ['command-spec-kit', 0.45]],\n  '/deep:review': [['system-deep-loop', 1.6], ['command-spec-kit', 0.45]],\n  '/speckit:resume': [['system-spec-kit', 0.9], ['command-spec-kit', 0.75]],\n  'auto review release readiness': [['system-deep-loop', 1]],\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"grep -n \"SKILL.md\\|mode contract\\|load\" .skilled/commands/create/skill.md | head -8; echo \"---DEEP-RESEARCH-CMD---\"; grep -n \"SKILL.md\\|mode contract\" .skilled/commands/deep/research.md | head -6; echo \"---DESIGN-EXTRACT---\"; grep -n \"SKILL.md\\|mode contract\" .skilled/commands/design/extract.md | head -6; echo \"---SPECKIT-PLAN-SKILL---\"; grep -n \"SKILL.md\" .skilled/commands/speckit/plan.md .skilled/commands/speckit/assets/speckit-plan.yaml | head -4; echo \"---EXPLICIT-BOOST---\"; sed -n '92,100p' .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts","time":{"start":1794477071827,"end":1794477071863}},"id":"prt_1cf2b1aec001xFPv5sXHXBkijn","sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","messageID":"msg_1cf2afddc001tRn8yKXxwb0kuH"}}
