{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794477119858,"sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_m2va7y5xfkklpddqz02se64r","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":7,\"run\":7,\"runId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-opencode-deepseek-1794475749931-e4ukfw\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Skill and command linkage\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"newInfoRatio\":0.75,\"noveltyJustification\":\"The metadata-versus-router load gap and the nine skillless-command set are new; the mode-registry linkage overlaps iteration 6, so the ratio is discounted.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which commands never load the mode SKILL.md their metadata names, which skills have no command front door, and should a skill recommendation imply its command?\",\"Which benchmark and fixture rows are needed for every command group and for chat-style prompts, and which metrics separate a missed command from a wrongly started one?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which commands never load the mode SKILL.md their metadata names, which skills have no command front door, and should a skill recommendation imply its command?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Treating metadata choreography as an enforced load\",\"Implying a command for every skill\"],\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/command-metadata.json\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json\",\".skilled/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json\",\".skilled/commands/create/skill.md\",\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/skill-advisor.md\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/git.md\",\".skilled/commands/prompt/improve.md\",\".skilled/commands/create/assets/create-skill-auto.yaml\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/mode-registry.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-12T09:51:45Z\",\"durationMs\":97000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-linkage\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Which commands never load their mode SKILL.md and should a skill imply its command\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-002\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Command routers load presentation and YAML, not the mode SKILL.md\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-006\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Nine skills have no dedicated command front door\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-007\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Imply a command only when the mode registry records one\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter007-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter007-002\",\"target\":\"q-linkage\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter007-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter007-006\",\"target\":\"q-linkage\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter007-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter007-007\",\"target\":\"q-linkage\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-001\",\"label\":\"All 19 metadata-backed commands declare a choreography that loads a mode SKILL.md, and every named mode file exists.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/command-metadata.json:1\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json:15\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-002\",\"label\":\"The executing command routers do not load the mode SKILL.md; /create:skill and /deep:research load a presentation contract and auto or confirm YAML only.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/create/skill.md:20\",\".skilled/commands/create/skill.md:28\",\".skilled/commands/deep/research.md:84\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-003\",\"label\":\"The workflow YAML does not close the gap: create-skill-auto and deep-research-auto own their steps without loading the mode SKILL.md.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/create/assets/create-skill-auto.yaml:29\",\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:26\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-004\",\"label\":\"The 17 doctor commands have no command-metadata and do not load a mode skill; 11 carry a skill_agent owner tag but the routers resolve a target from _routes.yaml and load a target YAML.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/skill-advisor.md:6\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/skill-advisor.md:12\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-005\",\"label\":\"/prompt:improve is the exception and explicitly loads the sk-prompt skill, the only non-hub command with an in-document skill load.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/prompt/improve.md:83\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-006\",\"label\":\"Nine skills have no dedicated command front door: cli-classifier, cli-external-orchestration, cli-orca, mcp-code-mode, mcp-tooling, sk-code, sk-git, system-skill-advisor and system-skilled-doctor.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/git.md:6\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-007\",\"label\":\"A skill recommendation should imply a command only when the selected mode's registry entry records a command, as sk-doc and system-deep-loop do; a blanket implication would fabricate commands for nine skills.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/mode-registry.json:40\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:45\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-008\",\"label\":\"Evidence against making the command primary: sk-doc marks its modes metadata-routed by hub membership and says a command-bridge mode is reached only via its command, never advisor-scored, so the command should sit beside the skill rather than replace it.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/mode-registry.json:13\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating metadata choreography as an enforced load\",\"reason\":\"Neither the command routers nor the workflow YAML read the mode SKILL.md\",\"iteration\":7}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Implying a command for every skill\",\"reason\":\"Nine skills have no command, so the implication would invent routes\",\"iteration\":7}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement/research/lineages/opencode-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl","time":{"start":1794477119852,"end":1794477119857}},"id":"prt_1cf2bc7450017O7r3fQXf4rLhc","sessionID":"ses_e30e8da22ffebDKB2cyvqFU701","messageID":"msg_1cf2bb32a0018UbgNVCp7JLH3Q"}}
